  "image_manifest_sha256": "2cef45844968315e32e03ffd4e0b9cff3269f3c88191ebd4333adc676803be8b",
  "review_method": "Inspected all 95 same-frame JPEG copies: complete tooltip-region contact sheets for 23 normal and 23 SHIFT views; execution, mode-switch and supplemental scene sheets; full inventory, gallery and both supreme frames. Source copies hash-checked against image-manifest.json.",
  "observations": [
    "Nine distinct item identities visible in gallery and inventory; no missing-texture pattern.",
    "All normal and SHIFT descriptions match their current modes; complete visible manuals and controls, no clipped footer or raw translation keys.",
    "C changes the description; native activation/cancel and regional selection visible.",
    "Effects and excavated/placed blocks visible; Icarus tunnels and the CORE DRILL execution are dark under ordinary Minecraft lighting, limiting their still-frame geometry detail. Native tests cover their route geometry and barriers.",
    "Worldloom gallery uses a deliberately elevated test anchor and occupied cells; it is not a survival-site placement demonstration. Native tests cover payment, orientation and safe geometry.",
    "Supreme execution and final wedge visible in first person; 9341 blocks removed; cancellation text at the terminal barrier is the current safety-stop feedback, not an assertion of all 96 slices being mined.",
    "Fixture-only vanilla Night Vision illuminates the supreme scene; tooltip overlay and bootstrap splash setting are test-only. No permanent tooltip HUD or Night Vision ability is shipped."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "No siege repository or test-1 access. No full modpack, shader, real claims configuration or multiplayer TPS certification."
  ]
}
